========================================================================
  PART 5: α₁ DECOMPOSITION: c₃ + c₅ + ...?
========================================================================


  At n=6: are there 7-cycles? No — a 7-cycle needs 7 vertices but n=6.
  So α₁ = c₃ + c₅ at n=6 (same as n=5).
  And c₃ is determined by scores.
  So Var(α₁|s) = Var(c₅|s) (exactly).

  Verified: α₁ = c₃ + c₅ for all 32768 tournaments at n=6 ✓
  (No 7-cycles possible at n=6)

  Decomposition: Var(H|s) = 4·Var(c₅|s) + 16·Var(α₂|s) + 16·Cov(c₅,α₂|s)

  Var(H|scores) at n=6 decomposed into:
